WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.460
Nyra had joined the team, but not everyone trusted her yet.

2
00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:07.790
Only Aslı and Sergeant never left her side.

3
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:12.960
Sergeant really likes you. And he's never wrong about people.

4
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.140
You trust a cat?

5
00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.480
A cat with a military rank. That's different.

6
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:23.180
Nyra laughed out loud for the first time. Then her face turned serious.

7
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.310
I know the Shadow's plan.

8
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.060
There's a copy machine in the castle's west tower. It will move the capsules there.

9
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.360
If it plugs the crystal piece into that machine, copies will replace the sleepers.

10
00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:40.800
The team split in two. Leon and Anka stayed in the hall to guard the capsules.

11
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.010
No capsule is leaving this hall. I promise.

12
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.780
The others climbed the west tower behind Nyra.

13
00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.490
At the top of the tower, a giant machine was humming.

14
00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.080
Inside were hundreds of empty capsules.

15
00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.490
Wow. This machine is either very evil or a very expensive washing machine.

16
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.560
But it wasn't the Shadow waiting by the machine. It was Sila.

17
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:10.400
My crimson warrior. I woke you. I created you. Come back to me.

18
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:16.020
You woke me, Sila. But Aslı's eyes showed me my heart.

19
00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.880
Nyra raised her sword and cut the machine's cables with a single blow.

20
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:25.580
The machine died in a shower of sparks. Sila screamed in rage.

21
00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.200
You'll pay for this! All of you!

22
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.860
Sila vanished in a red flash. But the crystal piece was still with the Shadow.

23
00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.670
Nyra, you're one of us now. Welcome home.

